bine relic effects to create unique strategies and boost your score.Different Builds Every Run: Experiment with color-focused, combo-focused, and other strategies as you work toward clearing each stage.The free demo lets you experience the core","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-15T09:18:28Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706676925","verified_at":"2026-10-20T18:49:35Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4923080-1840310314348850","game_id":"steam-4923080","kind":"announcement","title":"Puzzlogue Open Steam Playtest Now Live Until August 21","summary":"The open Steam playtest for Puzzlogue, a roguelike match-3 puzzle game, is now live.The playtest is free and open to all players through the playtest section on this Steam store page. It is scheduled to run until August 21, 2026.Puzzlogue is a roguelike match-3 puzzle game where players move gems continuously to set up multiple matches, create combos, and increase their score with effects gained during each run.In the playtest version, players can experience the core gameplay loop of Puzzlogue: ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-09T07:37:50Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1840310314348850","verified_at":"2026-10-20T18:49:35Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-4923080":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T15:16:43Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T15:16:43Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-4923080":"2026-10-26T15:16:43Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"4923080":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T15:16:43Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T15:16:43Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T15:16:43Z"},"5202410":{"last_attempt_at":"20